            "subfield": {
              "code": "a",
              "content": "\"Terms :- The leases shall be leases in perpetuity. The amount bid at the sale, not being less than the upset capital value, shall be the capital value upon which the annual rent of 2 1/2 per centum shall be calculated and paid for the first period of 20 years of the lease. For the remaining terms & conditions vide:- Gazette 6th May 1921.\""
